## §6 Acceptance criteria (L11 "acceptance criteria")

The node is `verified` **only** when all four commands exit 0 (backlog `conventions.accept`).

| # | Command (verbatim) | Satisfied by | Expected | Fails red until |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | `uv run python -c "import json,pathlib;json.loads(pathlib.Path('sakg/schema/envelope.schema.json').read_text())"` | WU-1…WU-4 | exit 0, no output | WU-1 |
| 2 | `uv run pytest tests/sakg/test_envelope_schema.py -q` | WU-8 (grading WU-1…WU-7) | exit 0, 15 passed | WU-8 |
| 3 | `test $(ls tests/sakg/fixtures/envelope/valid/*.json \| wc -l) -ge 12` | WU-5 | exit 0 (**14** ≥ 12) | WU-5 |
| 4 | `test $(ls tests/sakg/fixtures/envelope/invalid/*.json \| wc -l) -ge 8` | WU-6 | exit 0 (**13** ≥ 8) | WU-6 |

**Headroom is deliberate** (D§6): 14 vs floor 12, 13 vs floor 8. A later fixture deletion
